  "propositions": [
    {
      "text": "STEPS预测能源相关的二氧化碳排放在2020年代中期达到峰值。",
      "exactQuote": "The STEPS sees a peak in energy-related CO2 emissions in the mid-2020s",
      "blockId": "c-climate-004#block-5"
    },
    {
      "text": "STEPS预测排放仍然高到足以在2100年将全球平均气温推高至约2.4°C。",
      "exactQuote": "emissions remain high enough to push up global average temperatures to around 2.4 °C in 2100.",
      "blockId": "c-climate-004#block-5"
    },
    {
      "text": "到2030年使排放曲线向下弯曲所需的关键行动已广为人知，并且在大多数情况下成本效益非常高。",
      "exactQuote": "The key actions required to bend the emissions curve downwards to 2030 are widely known and in most cases very cost effective.",
      "blockId": "c-climate-004#block-6"
    },
    {
      "text": "将可再生能源容量增加两倍、将能效提升速度翻倍至每年4%、加速电气化以及大幅减少化石燃料运营中的甲烷排放，共同提供了到2030年使能源部门走上限制升温1.5°C路径所需的80%以上的减排量。",
      "exactQuote": "Tripling renewable energy capacity, doubling the pace of energy efficiency improvements to 4% per year, ramping up electrification and slashing methane emissions from fossil fuel operations together provide more than 80% of the emissions reductions needed by 2030 to put the energy sector on a pathway to limit warming to 1.5 °C.",
      "blockId": "c-climate-004#block-6"
    },
    {
      "text": "太阳能、风能、电动汽车和热泵等清洁能源技术的显著崛起正在重塑我们为从工厂、车辆到家用电器和供暖系统等一切提供动力的方式。",
      "exactQuote": "The phenomenal rise of clean energy technologies such as solar, wind, electric cars and heat pumps is reshaping how we power everything from factories and vehicles to home appliances and heating systems.",
      "blockId": "c-climate-004#block-8"
    },
    {
      "text": "全球道路上电动汽车的数量几乎是现在的10倍。",
      "exactQuote": "This includes almost 10 times as many electric cars on the road worldwide;",
      "blockId": "c-climate-004#block-9"
    },
    {
      "text": "太阳能光伏发电量超过整个美国电力系统目前的发电量。",
      "exactQuote": "solar PV generating more electricity than the entire US power system does currently;",
      "blockId": "c-climate-004#block-9"
    },
    {
      "text": "可再生能源在全球电力结构中的份额接近50%，而目前约为30%。",
      "exactQuote": "renewables' share of the global electricity mix nearing 50%, up from around 30% today;",
      "blockId": "c-climate-004#block-9"
    },
    {
      "text": "热泵和其他电加热系统在全球的销量超过化石燃料锅炉。",
      "exactQuote": "heat pumps and other electric heating systems outselling fossil fuel boilers globally;",
      "blockId": "c-climate-004#block-9"
    },
    {
      "text": "对新海上风电项目的投资是新建燃煤和燃气发电厂投资的三倍。",
      "exactQuote": "and three times as much investment going into new offshore wind projects than into new coal- and gas-fired power plants.",
      "blockId": "c-climate-004#block-9"
    },
    {
      "text": "所有这些增长仅基于世界各国政府当前的政策设定。",
      "exactQuote": "All of those increases are based only on the current policy settings of governments around the world.",
      "blockId": "c-climate-004#block-10"
    },
    {
      "text": "清洁能源技术日益增长的势头和全球结构性经济转变对化石燃料有重大影响，全球煤炭、石油和天然气需求峰值均在本十年内可见——这是基于当前政策设定的WEO情景中首次出现这种情况。",
      "exactQuote": "The combination of growing momentum behind clean energy technologies and structural economic shifts around the world has major implications for fossil fuels, with peaks in global demand for coal, oil and natural gas all visible this decade — the first time this has happened in a WEO scenario based on today's policy settings.",
      "blockId": "c-climate-004#block-12"
    },
    {
      "text": "在此情景下，化石燃料在全球能源供应中的份额（几十年来一直停留在80%左右）到2030年将下降至73%。",
      "exactQuote": "In this scenario, the share of fossil fuels in global energy supply, which has been stuck for decades at around 80%, declines to 73% by 2030.",
      "blockId": "c-climate-004#block-13"
    },
    {
      "text": "向清洁能源的转型正在全球范围内发生，且不可阻挡。",
      "exactQuote": "The transition to clean energy is happening worldwide and it's unstoppable.",
      "blockId": "c-climate-004#block-15"
    },
    {
      "text": "这不是一个“是否”的问题，而是一个“多快”的问题——而且越快对我们所有人都越好。",
      "exactQuote": "It's not a question of 'if', it's just a matter of 'how soon' — and the sooner the better for all of us.",
      "blockId": "c-climate-004#block-15"
    }
  ]
}
